@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-61 View Dashboard Overview

class "Admin Analytics UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "AnalyticsController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "AnalyticsService" as Service <<service>>
class "Bill" as Bill <<domain>>
class "ShoeDetail" as ShoeDetail <<domain>>
class "AnalyticsSummary" as AnalyticsSummary <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : GET /analytics/overview
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> Bill : uses
Service --> ShoeDetail : uses
Service --> AnalyticsSummary : uses

note right of UI
UC-61 - View Dashboard Overview
Actors: Admin, Manager
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Dashboard hiển thị metrics tổng quan
end note
@enduml
